<title>USA: Micron Electronics to hire 100.</title>
<headline>Micron Electronics to hire 100.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Micron Electronics said Monday it will add 100 employees over the next 12 months at its Minneapolis technical and sales support facility.</p>
<p>Micron said it has moved the current 350 employees based in Minneapolis to a larger facility, which the company estimates has space for 550 employees. The company has options for additional space in the area as well.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
